  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Assisted Return And Reintegration Programme For International Protection Applicants- Migrants In Vulnerable Situation In Ireland (2023)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Voluntary Assisted Return and Reintegration Project for 2023 will contribute to the Government of Ireland&#x2019;s comprehensive management of migration by providing return and reintegration support to migrants, in particular International protection applicants, identified potential Victims of Trafficking (VoTs) willing to return to their countries of origin or habitual residence and to contribute to their sustainable reintegration.</narrative>
  </description>
